{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51277","headline":"阙题 · 李白","name":"阙题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝披梦泽云，笠钓青茫茫。\n暮跨紫鳞去，海气侵肌凉。\n（《苕溪渔隐丛话前集》五引东坡。\n又《诗话总龟》七《评论门》引《百斛明珠》。\n云：「予都下见有人携一纸文书，字则颜鲁公也，墨迹如未乾，纸亦新健，其首两句云云。\n此语非太白不能道。\n」〖此即传爲李白所作之《上清宝鼎诗》中的四句，全诗及考证见《全唐诗续拾遗》卷十四。\n〗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}